{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『すべての犬は天国へ行く』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日無事初日を迎えました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間のない中の稽古でしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーで入ってくださった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さん方に助けられて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事スタートを切ることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が演じるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酒場の娘、クレメンタイン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月演じるマリネの義理の妹。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21歳です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/10/02/7591476/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな個性的なキャラクターで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの新たな一面が見られます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと驚くと思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観ているうちに舞台の雰囲気と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物語の面白さにのめり込むはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな脚本が私たちに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡ってきたことはすごく嬉しいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幅を広げるチャンスです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古から初日にかけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ苦戦しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日を終えて、気付いたことも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくつも見つかったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつひとつクリアにして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共演者のみなさんに学んで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この舞台をもっと楽しみたいと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/10/02/7591476/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/10/02/7591476/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日を終えての写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つるんとしてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/10/02/7591476/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中観に来てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲネプロ、初日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのメンバーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に来てくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さんも来てくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めまして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『すべての犬は天国へ行く』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もがんばるぞー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2015/10/02/7591476/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそくジャケ写のオフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もさっとした制服よいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}